    "corrections": [
      "0431: loose band never tied to sheep; empty cup stays away from dew; dawn porch has blanket and cup; route drawing and cart handles meet hands; multiple dew beds preserve wet meadow.",
      "0432: copper rules plate visible; opened/closed door states distinct; isolated leaf entrance actually disconnected, other leaves retain golden sand; draining path bypasses other leaves; three-branch return loop stays connected; pencil and eraser hands moved within reach.",
      "0433: 76, 24 and 100 actual coin symbols distinguish money states; exactly three trial belts; rental tag removed leaves pale square; repair buckle meets lock mouth; pinecone placement hand visible in empty chest; final white pebble separate from retained pinecone.",
      "0434: old dog is absent; four paw impressions, red ball, collar removal and packed belongings keep sequence; sadness and tear shown on page seven; large left forepaw touches ball; detached bell no longer obscures face; final forepaw raised in purple-gray shadow.",
      "0435: badge begins on page five; opened bag replaces closed bag instead of duplicating it; letter read on a supported shelf in front of whale; returned receipt stays in bag; outgoing letters already packed at page thirteen; model window and hand align; final mist travels from left-facing whale nose through nearby model windows."
    ],
    "limitations": "Simplified original geometric artwork. Full contact sheets and eighteen distinct full-size key pages actually viewed. This is not a human study or full audio listening/publication claim."
